            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "@id": "https://javavolcano-touroperator.com/why-jvto/reviews/186#crew-yandi",
            "url": "https://javavolcano-touroperator.com/why-jvto/reviews/186",
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Alicia"
            },
            "datePublished": "2025-07-24",
            "reviewBody": "We really loved and were very satisfied with this trip. Throughout the journey, we were well taken care of by Yandi and Kiki, who gave us many helpful suggestions for our itinerary. At Madakaripura, our guide Alim helped us take lots of great photos and videos, which made us really happy.\\n\\nAlthough the weather at Mount Ijen wasn't ideal, the views at Bromo were absolutely stunning, and the waterfall was also incredibly impressive.\\n\\nWe're truly grateful to JVTO for arranging and preparing this trip for us. It was a wonderful and fun experience, and one we'll remember for a long time.",
